### Column (Box) Selection

Selecting a rectangular block of text - useful for editing text formatted in columns.

1. **Mouse Method**: Hold `Shift + Alt` and drag the mouse vertically. A rectangular selection will be created.
2. **Keyboard Method**: You can also use `Shift + Alt + Left Arrow / Right Arrow / Up Arrow / Down Arrow` to create and expand a column selection.
3. **Column Selection Mode**: You can toggle a dedicated mode from the **Selection** menu or the **Status Bar**. When active, regular mouse selection and `Shift`+arrow keys will create column selections.

